/T (The 5 V input from connector J2 \(through the source V1\) reaches the push switch SW1. While SW1 is pressed, current flows into two parallel branches: \(a\) buzzer BZ1 directly, and \(b\) resistor R1 in series with LED D1. Both return to GNDPWR. A PWR_FLAG is placed on the ground net so the Electrical Rules Check recognises it as a powered net.)
/E (The 5 V input from connector J2 \(through the source V1\) reaches the push switch SW1. While SW1 is pressed, current flows into two parallel branches: \(a\) buzzer BZ1 directly, and \(b\) resistor R1 in series with LED D1. Both return to GNDPWR. A PWR_FLAG is placed on the ground net so the Electrical Rules Check recognises it as a powered net.)
